          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Expansion/retraction</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easy-to-use expansion and retraction with color-coded levers.</span></p>\n",
